cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the scientific report relevant to the result you use."
type: software
title: "OreBridge: Connected plant visualization and traceable process-engine evidence"
version: 0.01.001
authors:
  - family-names: Santibáñez-Leal
    given-names: Felipe
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0150-3246
    affiliation: "CAOS open-research programme, Santiago, Chile"
repository-code: https://github.com/fsantibanezleal/CAOS_OreBridge
url: https://github.com/fsantibanezleal/CAOS_OreBridge
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A connected 3D mineral-processing plant with synchronized process diagrams,
  observation histories, versioned upstream engine evidence, a configurable
  read-only OPC UA gateway, and reproducible synthetic model comparisons.
  Two causal prediction families are actually fitted and calibrated. The
  reference does not establish performance at an operating plant.
keywords:
  - mineral processing
  - 3D plant visualization
  - OPC UA
  - data reconciliation
  - causal forecasting
  - reproducible research
